From: Meriipu <Meriipu@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 15:13:26 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 10/12] tabbar: respect configured tab-min-width

tabs.js overwrites the user-configured value for tab-min-width with
a massive value of 50px so that tabs cant have a width below 50 which
causes the tablist to horizontally scroll with even modest number of
tabs open idk what the thinking was here but I dont think there was any
---
 browser/components/tabbrowser/content/tabs.js | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/browser/components/tabbrowser/content/tabs.js b/browser/components/tabbrowser/content/tabs.js
index 568f3a7cc705..460b52a3fed9 100644
--- a/browser/components/tabbrowser/content/tabs.js
+++ b/browser/components/tabbrowser/content/tabs.js
@@ -170,7 +170,7 @@
         null,
         (pref, prevValue, newValue) => this.#updateTabMinWidth(newValue),
         newValue => {
-          const LIMIT = 50;
+          const LIMIT = 1; // ?????????????????????????????????????????
           return Math.max(newValue, LIMIT);
         }
       );
